| 3 | A Conjuring of Light (2017) | 20-05-2024 | ENGLISH |
| 4 | A Crown of Swords (2006) | 20-05-2024 | ENGLISH |
| 5 | A Crown so Silver (2025) | 22-01-2025 | ENGLISH |
| 6 | A Crucible of Souls (2015) | 20-05-2024 | ENGLISH |
| 7 | A Curse of Krakens (2023) | 20-05-2024 | ENGLISH |
